WEBVTT - EduBridge Accessible Captions

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.759
Welcome to EduBridge. Today, we will
explore computer science and renewable energy,

00:00:06.759 --> 00:00:12.500
solar photovoltaic cells absorb sunlight
to generate clean electricity,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:18.000
through inclusive technology. Every
student can learn without barriers.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Let us begin our journey towards
accessible education for all.

